*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0004
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 235
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0004.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> CLAIMED AMOUNT
    05 CLAIM-AMT          PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> CLAIMS IN LAST 3 YEARS
    05 PRIOR-CLAIMS       PIC 9(2).
    *> MONTHS SINCE POLICY START
    05 POLICY-TENURE      PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> A=APPROVE I=INVESTIGATE D=DENY
    05 CLAIM-STATUS       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CLAIM-ROUTING
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-STATUS=" CLAIM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.
CLAIM-ROUTING.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> FAST-TRACK SMALL CLAIM
        WHEN CLAIM-AMT <= 2500 AND PRIOR-CLAIMS < 2
            MOVE 'A' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        *> LARGE CLAIM INVESTIGATION
        WHEN CLAIM-AMT > 25000
            MOVE 'I' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        *> NEW POLICY CLAIM
        WHEN POLICY-TENURE < 6
            MOVE 'I' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'A' TO CLAIM-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.
